Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们感谢帝查拉国王的赠礼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]黑豹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]吾儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]吾儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.09,0:02:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]至圣先王巴圣加国王后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]第一代黑豹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们释放你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]赞美祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[法语]法国收到情报指出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[法语]振金能用来制造大规模毁灭性武器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[法语]现有金属探测器无法侦测
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[法语]威胁到全球安全及武器禁扩原则
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]看不到保全影像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]立刻趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]脸朝地面 快…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]振金工具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]谁有权限
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]王后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]王后
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.38,0:36:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]王后
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.76,0:36:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]是 王后
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.58,0:48:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]杀了科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.94,0:48:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我来对付目击者
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.15,0:48:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.65,0:48:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]先杀了这个女的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.65,0:49:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]去找纳摩菈
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.80,0:50:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]杀鸡焉用牛刀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.92,0:50:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]怎么这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.86,0:50:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]现在不是闹着玩的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.33,0:53:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]请求发言
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.69,0:53:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]王后
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.40,0:54:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我求您
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.22,0:54:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我求您 王后
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.84,0:58:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.39,0:58:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你来找校长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.33,0:58:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]她在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.04,0:58:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]很好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.41,0:58:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.37,0:59:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你们先离开一下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.59,0:59:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.65,0:59:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.71,1:00:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.56,1:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]那是很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.77,1:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]公主
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.94,1:01:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]王室都穿传统服装
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.49,1:01:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们为您做好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.31,1:02:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.16,1:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.34,1:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]太太你好 很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.22,1:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.64,1:02:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我叫玛莉亚阿达娜 美里达来的学生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.66,1:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]没兴趣 拜托你走开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]没问题 我不想打扰你 听我说句话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.02,1:02:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我的教授提到一项研究
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.19,1:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你告诉研究人员 你碰到一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.57,1:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]一个难以想象的人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]跟外地人讲话准没好事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.41,1:03:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我求你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.00,1:03:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]快走开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.83,1:03:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我也碰过他
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.49,1:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有时会在海边看见一个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.66,1:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]脚上长翅膀的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.10,1:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们以为他是幽灵
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.86,1:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]库库尔坎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.90,1:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们的羽蛇神
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.13,1:03:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]统治着这里与底下的领域
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.95,1:03:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我很想去那座海滩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.79,1:03:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]但是要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.12,1:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]库库尔坎在这里的时间比你我更久
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.25,1:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]那些心怀不轨
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.59,1:04:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]去找他的人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.76,1:04:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]始终没有回来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.86,1:04:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]迷失在深海里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.80,1:04:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]永远消失
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.92,1:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]不 我的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你的宝宝生病了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.56,1:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]只有这个能治好他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.77,1:06:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你的宝宝会第一个在我们新家出生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.05,1:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]将这份礼物当成承诺
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.43,1:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]他将是我们的新国王
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.52,1:07:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.06,1:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]这是谁的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.70,1:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]射击
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.24,1:09:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]发射
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.47,1:09:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你是魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.57,1:09:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]撒旦之子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.45,1:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你是个缺少爱的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.48,1:09:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]缺少爱的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.90,1:20:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有人召唤您
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.22,1:20:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]库库尔坎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.40,1:23:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]把矛放下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.86,1:23:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]杀了公主
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]刀子放下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.49,1:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.99,1:24:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.97,1:24:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]放她走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.50,1:24:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你就不必死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.46,1:24:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]左手臂移开
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.62,1:25:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.55,1:25:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我的孩子怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.34,1:25:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]瓦坎达人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.97,1:25:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]他们来救她
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.39,1:25:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]库库尔坎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.91,1:25:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你能救我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.72,1:26:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]她死了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.50,1:26:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]对
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.26,1:26:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]安息吧 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.14,1:26:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]他们趁着…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.99,1:26:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你跟王后谈话的时候跑来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.37,1:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们不该信任她的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.50,1:26:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]公主见过我们家
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.99,1:26:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有什么能阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.59,1:26:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]攻击塔洛坎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.99,1:26:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我会阻止
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.13,1:27:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎奋起
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.12,1:27:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎奋起
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.04,1:27:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]为了寻求合作伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.29,1:27:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我一时不查
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.77,1:27:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]失去判断力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.42,1:27:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]同时…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.05,1:27:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我连累了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.86,1:27:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们大家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.78,1:27:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.35,1:27:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]绝对不再
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.95,1:27:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有所动摇
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.48,1:27:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]纳摩菈
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.58,1:27:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]阿杜玛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.46,1:28:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]等我们复仇成功
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.38,1:28:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]他们就再也不敢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.91,1:28:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]越雷池一步
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.12,1:28:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]接近塔洛坎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.93,1:28:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎奋起
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.39,1:30:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]谢谢你 妹妹
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.13,1:31:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]救这个
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.91,1:33:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]回去 调头
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.98,1:33:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]接住孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.83,1:34:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]战士
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.80,1:34:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.30,1:34:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]是
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.76,1:34:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们会找到你妈妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.32,1:34:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]护卫人员已被引出王宫
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.31,1:34:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]现在就看您的决定
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.51,1:36:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]求救
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.99,1:36:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]求救
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.68,1:38:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]救那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.97,1:39:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]加油 王后
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.55,1:39:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]醒醒 王后
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.62,1:39:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]让我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.54,1:40:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]醒过来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.69,1:40:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]醒来 王后
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.55,1:40:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]她去世了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.98,1:49:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.47,1:50:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]嗨 苏睿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.99,1:51:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.97,1:52:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]拉玛达
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.72,1:52:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们恳求您来到女儿身边
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.34,1:56:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.67,2:00:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.84,2:00:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]好
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.10,2:02:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]清楚了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.64,2:03:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.30,2:04:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]库库尔坎 另一台振金探测器
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.47,2:04:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]已在海洋中运作
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.05,2:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.46,2:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]冲出海面
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.90,2:08:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]撤回
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.44,2:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]击沉船只
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.04,2:13:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]战士
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.81,2:13:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你会说母语
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.42,2:13:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你能用它问候祖先
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.68,2:14:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你去见你的祖先吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.77,2:15:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我需要水
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.16,2:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我就是王
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.53,2:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我投降
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.26,2:19:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎人
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.35,2:19:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.41,2:19:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]这场战争结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:06.31,2:24:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你有什么心事 孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.83,2:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我一辈子渴望与您并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,2:24:17.82,2:24:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]想到您向瓦坎达人屈服…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.26,2:24:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]黑豹大可杀了我
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.93,2:24:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你想她为什么没动手
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.92,2:24:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]黑豹是陆上第一强国…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.80,2:24:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]权力最强大的人
Dialogue: 0,2:24:44.76,2:24:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]但她没有盟友
Dialogue: 0,2:24:48.14,2:24:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]现在她同情塔洛坎人
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.54,2:24:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]有了这个盟友
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.36,2:25:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]塔洛坎将比以往更强大
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.80,2:25:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]陆上世界将进攻瓦坎达
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.54,2:25:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]瓦坎达会向我们求援
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.06,2:25:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:26:12.06,2:26:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]我们走
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.98,2:26:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.98,2:26:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]不客气
Dialogue: 0,2:26:49.03,2:26:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]欢迎
Dialogue: 0,2:33:28.83,2:33:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[外语]你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bast...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is running out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请让我治好我哥的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please allow me to heal my brother of this illness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就再也不质疑你的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will never question your existence again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的心率快速下降 有什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart rate is dropping fast. Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即将完成一个序列\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are finishing a sequence now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥 给我控制台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot, give me the controls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信赖率多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the confidence rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,百分之二十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}25 percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得试另一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to try another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉国王的心率\N{\fnArial\fs30}King t'challa's heart rate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,降至每分钟31下\N{\fnArial\fs30}has fallen to 31 beats per minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主 您应该陪在他身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, you should go be by his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得思考 通通出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to think. Everyone, get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可信率多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the confidence rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,百分之二十九点一\N{\fnArial\fs30}29.1 percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Print it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主 我明白很紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, I am aware of the urgency,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我得提醒您\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I must warn you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种合成心型药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}this synthetic heart-shaped herb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,产生预期效果的概率微乎其微\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a minimal chance of producing the desired effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管 一定要成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care! Has to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥的心率多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my brother's heart rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去见祖先了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is with the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:03:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}t'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}t'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}t'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}t'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉 帝查拉 帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'challa, t'challa, t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}t'challa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我十分荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an honor for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邀请拉玛达王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}To invite her majesty, queen ramonda,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢蒙巴之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}daughter of lumumba,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达王国元首\N{\fnArial\fs30}sovereign ruler of the kingdom of wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主席先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chairperson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我能代表全体会员国发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I speak for all the member states here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到十分失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I say that I am deeply disappointed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达无法信守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}in wakanda's failure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与全球共同努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stand by promises to participate in global efforts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对国际上的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tackle international challenges,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分享资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}to share resources,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与各国充分合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and full cooperation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,处理振金的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}concerning vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在请拉玛达王后陛下发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now give the floor to her majesty, queen ramonda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我国政策始终不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has always been our policy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都不买卖振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}to never trade vibranium under any circumstance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原因不在振金的危险性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because of the dangerous potential of vibranium,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是你们的潜在危险性\N{\fnArial\fs30}but because of the dangerous potential of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位在此一副文明有礼的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You perform civility here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:09:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的领袖与军事单位窃窃私语\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you whisper in your halls of leadership and in your military facilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国王已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹已亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们失去了守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have lost their protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们进攻的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is our time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安妮卡 你的矛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aneka, where is your spear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿拿这些给我试用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri gave me these to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我比较喜欢它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I like them better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女祖先给我们矛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our foremothers gave us the spear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.65,0:10:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它精准 优雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it is precise, elegant...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有我在就别想换\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will not change under my watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就叫你别带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to bring them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我们又有一处交流中心遇袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night there was another attack on one of our outreach facilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某会员国涉入的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof of the involvement of a member state{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此时正上传到各位的移动设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}is being uploaded to your mobile devices as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于攻击者的身份…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for the identity of the attackers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们对此入侵行动的仁慈回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let our gracious response to this incursion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是希望递出橄榄枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}be an olive branch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若进一步觊觎我国资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further attempts on our resources{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将被视为侵略行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be considered an act of aggression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对更强烈的回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and met with a much steeper response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为国王驾崩哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mourn the loss of our king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但千万别以为瓦坎达失去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do not think for a second that wakanda has lost her ability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护资源的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect our resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白有些国家不断努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are aware of the ongoing efforts by some{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在瓦坎达境外寻找振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find vibranium outside of wakanda,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wish you the best of luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是625号直升机 请求准许降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is rotor 625 requesting clearance to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Meet you down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you retired!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I had too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说那机器找到振金的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that machine had a one in a billion chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是十亿分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}of finding vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, less than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舱压稳定 每平方寸负1磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cabin pressure is stable at negative one p-s-i.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深度800尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 800 feet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经过温跃层\N{\fnArial\fs30}passing through thermocline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的维生系统正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life supports in the green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们触底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've touched down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 萨拉札 你接近探勘点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. So, Salazar, you are near the site right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 很惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's astonishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钻头似乎接触到金属物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drill seemed to make contact with a metallic substance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么 都很坚硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it's solid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没见过钻头被破坏成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a drill bit chewed up like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.15,0:13:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海洋中的振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把探测器搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go ahead and get the detector out of there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟只有那一台\N{\fnArial\fs30}since it's the only one we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前往振金侦测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading towards the vibranium detector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨拉札 画面一片黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Salazar, we just went dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 钻机没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The rig lost power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. I'm gonna fix it up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me you're seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 萨拉札的心率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Salazar's heart rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨拉札 能给我画面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, Salazar, can you give me a visual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是冥河水母\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a phantom jellyfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没看过这颜色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen one this color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧急潜水小组待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency dive team, stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨拉札 我们失去杰克森的生命征象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar, uh, we just lost Jackson's vitals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了 是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you clarify? What do you mean by, "he's gone"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨拉札 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨拉札\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史密提 这里有状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smitty, we got a situation out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魏斯特 有看见声音来源吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}West, you got a visual on what's making that sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魏斯特 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}West, how copy, over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魏斯特 有看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}West, you got a visual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是某种声波攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of Sonic attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史密提 耳塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, smitty, earplugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭受攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻派突击队过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to send in a strike team immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.97,0:16:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 求救…这是625号直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Mayday, mayday, this is rotor 625.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要立即支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are requesting assistance immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the wakandans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韩德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史密提 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smitty, we gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韩德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henderson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开船缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旋转 甩掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin! Spin them off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 他们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. They're gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突击队在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the strike team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是瓦坎达人 他们是蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the wakandans. They... they were blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone is dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被往后拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting pulled backwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god! Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达国的拉玛达王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen ramonda of the nation of wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天在联合国发表撼动人心的演说\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave an electrifying speech at the UN yesterday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该国军人则护送被俘虏的佣兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}while members of her military escorted captive mercenaries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入联合国会场\N{\fnArial\fs30}onto the floor of the UN.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉玛达王后复位\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year has passed since queen ramonda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,担任瓦坎达元首已一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}was reinstated as ruler of wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉国王去年因不明疾病骤逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}after king t'challa's sudden death from an undisclosed illness last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全球都在关注这个强大的小国\N{\fnArial\fs30}All eyes are on the tiny, powerful nation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它近来日渐孤立…\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it finds itself increasingly isolated...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接近河界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching the river border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a moment. I'm in the middle of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解 公主 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, Princess, however...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干扰到我的思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're disrupting my train of thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.15,0:20:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想通知您 王后驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to tell you. The queen is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 那玩意害我不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - That thing unnerves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想有一天人工智能会杀光我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that one day artificial intelligence is going to kill us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人工智能不像电影演的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ai isn't like the movies, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它对我言听计从\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does exactly what I tell it to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 孩子也一样就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if only children were the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家似乎都在努力工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone seems to be working diligently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 迅速紧急反应任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Rapid emergency response task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来可能有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be any number of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各种未知的威胁 他们在研拟对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}unknown threats on the horizon, and they're creating solutions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给军队穿的外甲装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exo suits for our army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赋予使用者超人类力量 速度及耐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It grants the user super-human strength, speed, and durability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但一如往常 奥克耶有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, as always, okoye had notes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were her notes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hates them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重制心型药草呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about recreating the heart-shaped herb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有任何进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you made any progress on that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雅阿之女娜奇雅又想与您联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia, daughter of yaa, is trying to reach you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许您应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你应该照我的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should continue your calculations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I instructed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要的不是药草 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not need the herb, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要新技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need new technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那黑豹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the black panther?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:22:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个角色数世纪以来团结了我们国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mantle has unified our nation for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹是古董了 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther is a relic, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想用药草拯救黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't trying to save the mantle with the herb,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想救我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to save my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道今天什么日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what day it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指日期 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥的祭日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother's passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一年前的今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year ago today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么安排吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you planned anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.49,0:22:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有 请你载妈妈出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It involves you taking your mother for a drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right now? - Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把基莫由珠留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can leave your kimoyo beads here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 母后 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mother. - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去的地方用不上它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't need them where we are going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有另外两颗 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other two. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得陪我一起沉思 静下心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to sit here with me. And with yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯有如此才能疗愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only way you are going to heal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉之死带来的创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the wound caused by t'challa's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.05,0:23:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必替我操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他走了 但我要往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, but I'm moving forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.97,0:23:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉死了 不代表他离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'challa is dead, but that doesn't mean he is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那场病带走了你哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that illness took your brother from us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得带领受伤的国家和受损的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to lead a wounded nation and a broken world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是抽空到野外来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still took time in the bush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一路漫步到发现水为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wandered until I found water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I sat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.29,0:24:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后进行一场…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I did this ritual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.12,0:24:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我即将做给你看的仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am about to show you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现你哥在微风中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found your brother in the breeze,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温柔而坚定地推着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}pushing me gently, but firm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的手彷佛搭在我肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like his hand on my shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花了一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took some time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.35,0:24:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他真的在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.53,0:24:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不在 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't there, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感受到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The presence that you felt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是你的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}was just a construct of your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:25:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样你才能感到一点安慰或喜悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought on so you could feel some comfort orjoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.71,0:25:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.17,0:25:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你想到你哥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}What construct does your mind create{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心中想到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you think of your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它有给你安慰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it offer you comfort?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.47,0:25:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or torment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.38,0:25:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.55,0:25:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这和你的仪式有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this have to do with your ritual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.47,0:25:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,焚烧葬礼服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning of the funeral garments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,象征哀悼期结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}marks the end of the mourning period{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.39,0:26:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与已离世的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the beginning of a new relationship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,展开一段新的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our loved ones that have passed on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I sit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.61,0:26:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想念哥太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}and think about my brother for too long,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会烧的就不是这些衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}it won't be these clothes I'll burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.66,0:26:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和其中的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.00,0:26:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事我必须告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri, there's something that I need to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与你哥有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.85,0:26:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.58,0:27:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这最好不是仪式的一环\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better not be a part of your ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.58,0:27:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.54,0:27:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? And how did you get in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.68,0:27:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空气好原始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The air is pristine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.77,0:27:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲说过这种地方的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother told stories about a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.23,0:27:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,化外之地 人们永远不必离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}A protected land with people that never have to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.56,0:27:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不必改变自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}That never have to change who they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.49,0:27:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们向世人公开秘密的原因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What reason do you have to reveal your secret to the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.53,0:27:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样的话我不喜欢讲第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a woman who enjoys repeating herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.66,0:27:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有许多名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have many names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,族人叫我库库尔坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people call me k'UK'ulkan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但敌人叫我纳摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my enemies call me namor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.05,0:27:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美军在我国底下探测到振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American military detected vibranium under my nation's domain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已阻止他们开采\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was able to stop them from minin' it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但需要瓦坎达协助才能防止旧事重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need wakanda's help to prevent it from happenin' again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们利用一名美国科学家设计的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use a machine designed by an American scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.11,0:28:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有这里才有振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium only exists here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}In wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.28,0:28:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后 他身上包覆着振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, he's covered in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.53,0:28:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子向世人展现振金的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son exposed the power of vibranium to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他国家因而展开搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}In response, other nations have begun searching the planet for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的决定连累了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}His choice has compromised us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达能找到那名科学家 带来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think wakanda could find the scientist and bring them to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达协助解决我们的困境才公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only fair that wakanda helps to resolve our dilemma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.72,0:28:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准你潜入我国 跟我说什么叫公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not sneak into my country and tell me what is fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.43,0:28:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的士兵比这里的叶子还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have more soldiers than this land has blades of grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.31,0:28:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且实力惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have incomparable strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.52,0:28:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想在不同的情况下回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hate to come back under different circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你们找到那科学家 往这里面吹气\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you have the scientist, blow into this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.29,0:29:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放在海洋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}place it in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.08,0:29:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there shortly afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.63,0:29:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your own sake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别对瓦坎达以外的人提到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't mention anything about me to anyone outside of wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.85,0:29:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到他脚踝上的翅膀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the wings on his ankles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.12,0:29:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须召开议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must convene the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.83,0:29:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天眼完全没监测到任何活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven scrapers had no evidence of any activity at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.25,0:30:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,河界遭人突破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the river border has been breached, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.18,0:30:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我的士兵在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my soldiers were present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个"鱼人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}this "fish man"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.43,0:30:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此时就被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be bound before us as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.35,0:30:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的肌肉脑大军在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your muscle brains were present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.77,0:30:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还会在那边被自己的羽毛呛到\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would still be there choking on their fuzzy adornments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.02,0:30:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个光头魔鬼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bald-headed demon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.36,0:30:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位放尊重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show some respect, you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.32,0:30:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.48,0:30:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人应该感到惭愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men should be ashamed to show their faces!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意你的口气 贾巴里人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your tone, Jabari!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚说到\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空中监测画面没拍到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was no aerial surveillance footage of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷达也没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing on the radar as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.67,0:30:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他在水中游了一百公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he swam underwater for 100 kilometers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他并非独行侠 还声称指挥一支大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was not alone. And claims to command a massive army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我们送上一名美国科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to deliver one American scientist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他动手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he can kill them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.77,0:30:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.15,0:31:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前不必面对拥有振金的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never had to face an enemy with access to vibranium before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.74,0:31:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如今没有黑豹保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have no black panther to protect us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这睿智的议会容许齐尔蒙格登基\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is because this wise council allowed killmonger to take the throne{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烧光珍贵的心型药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burn up all of your precious heart-shaped herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恩巴库 你建议我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}M'Baku, what would you have us do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该找到那个鱼人 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should find the fish man and kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果现在照他的话做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do what he is asking for now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如何防止他回来 得寸进尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is to stop him from coming back and asking for more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.02,0:31:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,平身\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.77,0:31:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我想太多 还是它变丑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me, or does this keep getting uglier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.03,0:31:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有用吗 - 有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, does it work? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.11,0:31:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意能侦测到变更过的振金频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing can detect the altered frequency of vibranium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.99,0:31:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,透过水 石头甚至重金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}through water, stones, even heavy metals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.20,0:31:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,设计者太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever built this is brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.33,0:31:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:32:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有的是订制零件 有的则像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are custom parts and others look like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.17,0:32:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回收场捡来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they gathered it from a junkyard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.09,0:32:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am still struggling to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.67,0:32:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达境外出现振金\N{\fnArial\fs30}that vibranium exists outside of wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许陨石不只一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps there was more than one meteorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.97,0:32:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地表大部分是水 不难想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our planet is covered of mostly water, so it's reasonable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外一颗落入海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the other one just landed there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这改变了我们的所有认知\N{\fnArial\fs30}This changes everything that we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.39,0:32:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大山岗 所有的传说和寓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great mound. All of the legends and fables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.56,0:32:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些故事深深烙印在我心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those stories are seared in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.61,0:32:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烙印听起来好痛哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds very painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.70,0:32:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们终究得找到这个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to find this scientist after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.32,0:32:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.83,0:32:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要公主协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need the Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.33,0:32:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.41,0:32:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她根本不适合外出\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is in no state to be in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.00,0:32:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出门对她或许有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may do her some good to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.01,0:32:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可能正是她需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might just be exactly what she needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.22,0:32:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何况我闭眼睛都能执行这项美国任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I can do this American operation with my eyes closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.43,0:32:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心的不是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the Americans that I'm worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个纳摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This namor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他轻易突破我们的边防\N{\fnArial\fs30}he snuck past our defenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.73,0:33:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种事不会再发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will never happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他并非一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有我在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.57,0:33:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.53,0:33:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}when are we leavin'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.70,0:33:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想见我最喜欢的殖民者\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can see my favorite colonizer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.85,0:33:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.02,0:33:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.40,0:33:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.94,0:33:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能慢一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you slow down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没先打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think to call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.70,0:34:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有你的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would I have your number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找建造振金探测器的科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are looking for the scientist who built the vibranium detector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.25,0:34:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在大西洋里的是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was you guys in the Atlantic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.59,0:34:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来 开采船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Mining ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.42,0:34:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伤亡惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是联合行动 我们和海豹部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a joint operation. Us and the seals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们30名菁英 我们2名优秀探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty of their top guys, two of our best officers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.77,0:34:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.23,0:34:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.40,0:34:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就那样走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.07,0:34:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们在追踪振金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You throw in the fact that they were tracking vibranium...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.07,0:34:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证瓦坎达与此事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you wakanda had nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.32,0:34:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 我们原本应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, look, the way that this is supposed to work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,互通情报 有来有往\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I give you information and you reciprocate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.50,0:34:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了安全起见 我们不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our own safety, we cannot tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须先找到那个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's imperative that we get to the scientist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以免又出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}before anything else happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我一次 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me, Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.84,0:34:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.18,0:34:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.97,0:35:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些被判死刑的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are agents who have been sentenced to death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.39,0:35:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泄漏的情报都没这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}for less than I'm about to give you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了新的局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got a new director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.56,0:35:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她紧盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's watching me like a hawk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.10,0:35:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会非常非常小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be very, very careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.86,0:35:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只小心 动作要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just careful, you gotta be fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.02,0:35:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国需要另一台机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The us needs another machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界只有这小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this kid is the only person in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道怎么建造\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows how to build one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're comin' for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.82,0:35:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.92,0:35:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot to venmo me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.13,0:35:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了 八百对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it slipped my mind. It's eight hundred, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.34,0:35:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八百是昨天的价码 今天一千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight hundred was yesterday's price. It's a band today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.43,0:35:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抢钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's predatory. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.34,0:35:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了整只机械手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built the whole robotic hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只修正了抓握算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just corrected the grip algorithm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.89,0:35:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到什么成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what grade did you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.57,0:35:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.74,0:35:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是iPhone吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an iPhone I see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很低阶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.53,0:36:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到那个科学家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have located the scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的学校跟瓦坎达乡村学校同等级\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is in the American equivalent of a wakandan village school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}A school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.83,0:36:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托跟我说她是教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me it is a professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.34,0:36:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是学生 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a student, mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能把她交给纳摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't give her to namor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.63,0:36:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个学生带回瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring this student back to wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.85,0:36:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.56,0:36:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 也许我该跟她谈一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Maybe I should speak with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样比较低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be more discreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以很低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be discreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.98,0:36:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事 - 化妆的关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - Is it the makeup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.74,0:36:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 粉底颜色不对 - 颜色没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the wrong shade, isn't it? - It's the right shade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.11,0:36:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fenty 440 很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fenty 440. You look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能假装成学生混进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can blend in as a student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.25,0:36:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给你五分钟 - 赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You get five minutes. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.01,0:37:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.18,0:37:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉威廉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riri Williams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.69,0:37:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不让人直接来 你得上网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, I don't do drop-bys no more. You gotta go to the website.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.86,0:37:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一个加密档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an encrypted file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.94,0:37:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想隔空投送\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to airdrop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.16,0:37:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.07,0:37:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是苏睿公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Princess shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跑来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.00,0:37:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠 我要被征召了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit, am I getting recruited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想问你为中情局做的振金探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here about the vibranium detector that you built for the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为中情局做 是为了冶金学课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't built no detector for no CIA. I made that for my metallurgy class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.93,0:37:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 学校作业 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A school project? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.30,0:37:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教授说我绝对做不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My professor said I'd never be able to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.64,0:37:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我是年轻有才华的黑人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be young, gifted, and black though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.90,0:37:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在瓦坎达应该不会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all probably don't say that in wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:37:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你几岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.36,0:38:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,19岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nineteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长辈不见得能接受年轻有为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliance at a young age is not always accepted by the elders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.37,0:38:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你花了多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did it take you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.12,0:38:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.37,0:38:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 几个月 - 最难的部分是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Couple months? - The hardest part was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.12,0:38:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到够大的麦拉片来盖住…\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding big enough mylar sheets to cover the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.71,0:38:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我惹毛瓦坎达了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, did I piss offwakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.34,0:38:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里不安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is no longer safe for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.30,0:38:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收拾东西跟我走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather your things and come with me. Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我15分钟后要上微分方程课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got differential equations class in, like, 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.18,0:38:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.27,0:38:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.69,0:38:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去上厕所 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go to the bathroom. I'm just gonna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.36,0:38:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说五分钟 给了你六分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said five minutes. I gave you six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去 滚出我宿舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. Get out of my dorm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.70,0:38:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你们 别再过来一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you! Do not take another step toward me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.88,0:38:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是怎么教孩子招待客人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how they teach the children to treat their guests? Mm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.51,0:39:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带矛进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a spear in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.93,0:39:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带矛进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a spear in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.01,0:39:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.64,0:39:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂…放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.89,0:39:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂…放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down, put it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.48,0:39:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会受伤的 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll hurt yourself. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.14,0:39:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.90,0:39:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small, small girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to give you two options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以来瓦坎达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come to wakanda,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.74,0:39:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以清醒或昏迷状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}conscious or unconscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.82,0:39:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才得清醒一下 看看你的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be conscious of the way that you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.74,0:39:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顶着一张灰灰的脸趴趴走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking round here, all that ash on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.62,0:39:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好笑吗 - 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, it's funny? - No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.21,0:39:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就跟你说 - 很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you! - You look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.38,0:39:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. We'll leave, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.50,0:39:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她能单独对付那个脚踝有翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can deal with that merman with the winged ankles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想杀她的人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wants to kill her all by herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.89,0:39:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你可以的 - 用你的暖炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got this. - Mm, with your heater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走了啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.27,0:39:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.36,0:40:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.82,0:40:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮卫生局长修过卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fixed a few trucks for the head of sanitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.61,0:40:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就让我在这车库工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lets me work out of this garage in exchange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.91,0:40:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得拿工作用的笔电\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to grab my work laptop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.20,0:40:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.17,0:40:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这你别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.46,0:40:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来不多 却是我毕生的心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not look like much, but it's my life's work in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机器的设计在笔电里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the design for the machine is on that laptop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就放在车库的桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just leave it on a desk in a car garage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我设了2065字节加密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 2065-byte encryption on that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 有害自己打不开过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impressive. Ever locked yourself out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了整学期才解锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me the whole semester to get back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.44,0:40:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了破解自己的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to build a functional quantum computer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.65,0:40:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还组了一台量子电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to crack my own encryption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在建造什么 是史塔克科技吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you're building here? Is it stark tech?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.20,0:40:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主 美国执法人员抵达您的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, American law enforcement has arrived at your location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可恶 - 那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.83,0:40:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人工智能\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.45,0:40:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要包围我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are surrounding us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.92,0:41:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你说有人鱼在追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said a merman was after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.71,0:41:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the feds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.14,0:41:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在别来乱啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I do not need this shit right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.73,0:41:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to god, I was doing so well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.11,0:41:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准时上课 我真是蠢爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goin' to class on time. I must be dumb as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.82,0:41:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真蠢 我以为瓦坎达公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real dumb thinking that the Princess of wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.53,0:41:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会出现在门口 现在却来了联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna show up at my doorstep and then shit about to pop off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.99,0:41:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我要冒险去找那个人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that I'm actually gonna take my chances with this merman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.83,0:41:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他没带联邦探员到我车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}because at least he never brought the FBI to my garage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.71,0:41:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 纳摩击沉载满中情局特务的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Namor sank an entire ship of CIA operatives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.21,0:41:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是联邦调查局 就因为你的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the federal bureau of in vestigation. Because of your little machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的执法人员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So those popo out there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.59,0:41:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你最不必担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the very least of your worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得合作才能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we need to work together to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.47,0:41:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 他们把我们包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, they've got us surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.06,0:41:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们该分开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.94,0:42:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.39,0:42:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这车子能动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this vehicle work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.11,0:42:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这实验室一切都能用 包括这辆机车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in this lab works. Including this bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.57,0:42:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想 而且我们有三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it. Besides, there are three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.74,0:42:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个 我开这台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of y'all. I'm takin' this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.91,0:42:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.33,0:42:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我说你两个月就做好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that you built this in two months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续花了好多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent years on this. On and off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.25,0:42:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 你飞过它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. Have you flown it yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.00,0:42:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing can fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.21,0:42:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有整个网络影音频道都是我的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an entire YouTube channel dedicated to sightings of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.13,0:42:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.68,0:42:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们有拘捕令 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a warrant to detain... - Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.34,0:42:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要拘提学生莉莉威廉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The student riri Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.89,0:42:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无线发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wireless transmitter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.18,0:42:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们才能沟通 - 别想偷溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so we can communicate. - Don't try to scurry off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.56,0:42:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶将军 苏睿公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}General okoye, Princess shuri,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手举高走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come out with your hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.61,0:42:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一堆废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a hunk ofjunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.81,0:42:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 麻烦小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, please be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.99,0:42:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不会被捕 - 钥匙在座位上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will not be placed under arrest. - Keys are on the seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦过了桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get to the other side of the bridge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.95,0:42:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能在波士顿车阵中甩掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can lose them in Boston traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 我们非分开不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, we really need to split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.32,0:43:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好 这不是你的实验室 这是外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. We are not in your lab. We are in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.74,0:43:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫她上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get her in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.75,0:43:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爱吼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always shouting at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.67,0:43:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机动小组冲进入口 倒数三 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tactical unit will breach the entrance in three, two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.97,0:43:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.14,0:43:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠 她有钢铁人装 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! She got an iron man suit? Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.02,0:43:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.07,0:43:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它果然能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it can fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.27,0:43:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 葛里奥 - 是 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Griot! - Yes, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.73,0:43:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快 - 远端驾驶启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Remote piloting activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.44,0:43:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.58,0:43:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.46,0:43:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.84,0:44:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 葛里奥 - 是 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Griot... - Yes, general?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.35,0:44:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我去找公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to the Princess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.39,0:44:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我的矛就插进你的中央处理器\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will drive my spear so deep into your cpu,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.23,0:44:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一千年都别想复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will not be able to process basic input for a millennia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.56,0:44:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请稍候 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one moment, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.98,0:44:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶 我去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye, I'm on my way to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥 快让我操控这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}griot, give me control of this vehicle right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.79,0:44:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在帮你开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am clearing you a path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.63,0:44:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all yours, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.05,0:44:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行手动驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual drive engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.65,0:44:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找个撤离点\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to find an extraction point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.28,0:44:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,河对岸有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one across the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.99,0:45:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要封锁桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, yo, they cuttin' off the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.75,0:45:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主 有一架监视无人机锁定您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, there is a surveillance drone locked onto you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.67,0:45:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多高\N{\fnArial\fs30}How high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.92,0:45:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三万尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-thousand feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.26,0:45:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.97,0:45:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快啊 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, riri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.06,0:45:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得找到微分方程\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta find these differential equations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.48,0:45:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等相对速度拉平…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the relative velocity evens out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.35,0:45:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉 没有氧气罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riri, I'm not sure you can reach that drone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.40,0:45:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你恐怕追不上无人机\N{\fnArial\fs30}without an oxygen mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.03,0:45:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含氧量55%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen level is now 55%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两万八千尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-eight thousand feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.91,0:45:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含氧量30%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen level is now 30%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.62,0:45:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最大加速 我只要调整欧拉角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum acceleration. I just need to adjust my euler angles and that should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.38,0:45:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该能让它落在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should drop it right on the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.13,0:46:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含氧量0%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen, 0%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.35,0:46:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无人机不再追踪您\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drone is no longer tracking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.23,0:46:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高度五百尺 下降中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude, 500 feet and falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riri! Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莉莉 - 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Riri! - Yea h.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.53,0:46:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.53,0:46:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来了 - 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Incoming! - Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.65,0:46:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming! Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.99,0:46:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可恶 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - And no worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.12,0:46:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我送特别快递来 倒数三…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a special delivery for y'all in three,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.28,0:46:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.25,0:46:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, riri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.33,0:47:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened? Shun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.39,0:47:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主生命征象稳定 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Princess's vitals are stable, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.81,0:47:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稍后应该会恢复意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should regain consciousness momentarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.84,0:48:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再靠近一步…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take another step closer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.72,0:48:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就杀光你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and iwill kill you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.93,0:48:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.73,0:48:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是蓝色的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is she blue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.83,0:50:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.42,0:50:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.50,0:50:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating interpretation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.96,0:50:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.21,0:50:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess of wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.97,0:50:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们带我去找纳摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I demand that you take me to namor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.93,0:50:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要伤害这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not bring harm to this girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.72,0:51:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两人都活捉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we take them both alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 阿杜玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, attuma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.70,0:51:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.75,0:51:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.19,0:51:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是中情局的罗斯 有目击者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross, from the agency. You got any witnesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.03,0:51:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们认为是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}None. But we think it was the wakandans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.61,0:51:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总部告知他们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our field office got a tip from Langley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.91,0:51:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总部告知他们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.07,0:52:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 谁打的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Who made that call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.71,0:52:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德芳亭局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director de fontaine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.17,0:52:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.25,0:52:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探员认为是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, agent thinks it was the wakandans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.67,0:52:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们摧毁那艘船后 我们就紧迫盯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've been on every one of them since they took out our ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.34,0:52:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才要你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I wanted you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.84,0:52:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lookin' good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.22,0:52:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, I try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.76,0:52:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家里弄了健身室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put that home gym in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.35,0:52:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 去年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定改天去你家踩飞轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll drop by sometime and jump on your peloton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.98,0:52:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.06,0:52:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是负责指挥的特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm special agent in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.06,0:52:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 要向我说明物证吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good for you. You wanna walk me through the evidence here, or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.23,0:52:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是 你先请 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Okay. - After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为是车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we think it was a car crash,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.07,0:52:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是找不到车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're having trouble finding the cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.99,0:52:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思 发现时就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? It was just like this when you found it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.41,0:52:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 应该有人移走车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We think someone involved got rid of the vehicles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.20,0:52:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么移走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got rid of them how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.45,0:52:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢进河里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They dumped them into the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.08,0:52:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.33,0:52:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面有麻省理工学院贴纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got an mit sticker on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.08,0:52:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻传给国安局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that transferred to the NSA immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.63,0:52:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯 你油箱满的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ross? You got a full tank of gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.88,0:52:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能载我回总部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give me a ride back to Langley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.13,0:53:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车程八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an eight-hour drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.93,0:53:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们能聊聊这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We can talk about the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.47,0:53:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, wouldn't mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.93,0:53:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为离婚前我说的几件事道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologizing to you for a couple of things I said during our marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是蓝色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.90,0:53:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们具有超人类的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they had superhuman strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.65,0:53:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑着鲸鱼从水中冒出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they came from the water on the backs of whales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.36,0:53:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我击倒三个 以为杀死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I struck down three of them with blows that should've killed them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.66,0:53:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们又爬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they Rose again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.54,0:53:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望立刻出发 救回公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to leave immediately to retrieve our Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.59,0:53:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.18,0:53:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将被摘除瓦坎达军队将军的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be stripped of your rank as general of wakanda's armies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及朵拉亲卫队的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your status as dora milaje.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.03,0:53:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.03,0:54:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已付出一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.45,0:54:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我为拯救国家及王位而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me die saving my country and that throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.58,0:54:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请容我将功赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to make this right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.46,0:54:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将功赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Make it right"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.38,0:54:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的女儿生死未卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know if my daughter is alive or dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们操之过急了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we are being too hasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了瓦坎达 她拿着矛对抗丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She raised a spear against her own husband for wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.56,0:54:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的背骨丈夫如今仍在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is her treacherous husband now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.27,0:54:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想看还是能去看他 而我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in a place where she can visit if she wished? Mine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.86,0:54:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经与祖先同在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is with the ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.82,0:54:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是世界第一强国的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am queen of the most powerful nation in the world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.78,0:54:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全家人却都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my entire family is gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.83,0:54:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有付出一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I not given everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.80,0:55:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.89,0:55:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,齐尔蒙格登基后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stood by you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.27,0:55:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我依然大力支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}after killmonger took the throne,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.06,0:55:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我去请求贾巴里人保护时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and the elders in this room stood by him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.81,0:55:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和在场的长老却支持他\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I ran begging to the Jabari for protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.82,0:55:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你这次任务别带我女儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I warned you about taking my daughter on this mission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.37,0:55:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却害她失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you lost her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.04,0:55:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.45,0:55:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.71,0:56:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗 葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here, griot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.59,0:56:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.88,0:56:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿被绑架时你在她身边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you with shuri when she was abducted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.43,0:56:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.89,0:56:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能追踪她的基莫由珠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you able to track her kimoyo beads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.81,0:56:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弹道监识组在剑桥各处发现子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ballistics found slugs all over Cambridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.31,0:56:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些瓦坎达人到处趴趴走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those wakandans really took a tour of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不懂他们怎么查出谁建造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see how they figured out who built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.40,0:56:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是高度机密情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}That information is highly classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.41,0:56:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.16,0:56:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 新的铃声吗 - 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a new ringtone? - Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.99,0:56:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,局长 抱歉 我得接一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, director, I'm sorry. I'm gonna have to take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.08,0:56:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别叫头衔 接吧 我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough with the titles. Just take it. I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.62,0:56:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, honey sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我老板在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, I'm... I'm with my boss. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.88,0:57:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, she's leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.42,0:57:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.59,0:57:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在家工作 然后洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna work from home, and then have a shower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.43,0:57:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾佛瑞特罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everett Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.10,0:57:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉玛达王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen ramonda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.39,0:57:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿苏睿的基莫由珠做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with shuri's kimoyo beads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.44,0:57:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know they were hers. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在一个惨烈的犯罪现场发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found them at a pretty ugly crime scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.78,0:57:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个学生在你们手上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the student?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.78,0:57:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿想救她 结果两人都遭挟持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri was trying to save her when they were both taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.66,0:57:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 被谁挟持\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Taken by who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.70,0:57:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我局里认为是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My agency assumes it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.83,0:57:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心他们可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm worried they might be onto the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.96,0:57:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为苏睿和奥克耶指引方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I pointed shuri and okoye in the right direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.37,0:57:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她们有危险 我想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if they're in danger, I wanna help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.17,0:57:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我得了解实情才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't if I don't know what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.25,0:57:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在恐怕有一个新的世界强权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid there is a new world power at play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.38,0:57:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已掌握的国家 还是别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A country that's already on our radar? Or you mean someone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.51,0:57:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前我只能说这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all I can say for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.68,0:57:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.10,0:57:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贵国政府若决定对怀疑之事采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}alert me if your government decides to act{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请先告知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}on their suspicions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.52,0:58:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.35,0:58:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能帮什么忙 尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, if there's anything I can do to help, let me know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.44,0:58:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的命是苏睿救回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe shuri my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.98,0:58:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥 苏睿戴着耳环吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot, did shuri have her earrings with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.07,0:58:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在北大西洋失去踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost track of them in the north Atlantic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.78,0:58:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带走她的人说犹加敦马雅语\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the people who took her spoke yucatec Mayan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.56,0:59:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.64,0:59:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的一切都能让孩子学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is a lesson here for the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.10,0:59:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会粉刷墙壁 喂鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They painted the walls, they feed the fish,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.27,0:59:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,种我们吃的所有食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they grow everything we eat here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.73,0:59:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些概念我并不陌生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognize some of the concepts here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.53,0:59:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你用了不同的素材\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are using different material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 我们只用海地找得到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we use strictly what we can find here in Haiti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.99,0:59:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家发现你没参加帝查拉的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were missed at t'challa's funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.09,0:59:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.47,1:00:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你离开我们六年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been six years since you left us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.60,1:00:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你至少会回来参加葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you would at least come back for the ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.52,1:00:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.90,1:00:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葬礼就代表他真的走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how final the funeral would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.78,1:00:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜奇雅 雅阿之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia, daughter of yaa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.11,1:00:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你去哪里 都是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherever you go, you are still wakandan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.16,1:00:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道死亡不是终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know death is not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.92,1:00:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老家的乡亲还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is everyone at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿遭挟持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri has been taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.89,1:00:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.30,1:00:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经渗透过许多国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have infiltrated many nations before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.73,1:00:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我跟现在不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a different person then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.14,1:00:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要有人查出她被关在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone who can find where she is being held,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.36,1:00:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,营救她 暗中行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rescue her, without being seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.78,1:00:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会甘冒与瓦坎达开战的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who on earth would risk war with wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.99,1:01:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.16,1:01:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, breathe. Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.53,1:01:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别叫我呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't tell me to breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.16,1:01:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.33,1:01:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在洞穴里 我不确定是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a cave. I'm not sure where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.54,1:01:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.17,1:01:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.83,1:01:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萤火虫 它们的幼虫会发光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glow worms. Their larva gives off light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.42,1:01:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.01,1:01:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有新的黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, is there, like, a new black panther{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.97,1:01:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能叫来接我们 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that you can call to come and get us? - No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.39,1:01:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.47,1:01:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it doesn't work like that anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.01,1:01:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.27,1:01:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被绑架 你们却没黑豹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So y'all stopped having black panthers when I get kidnapped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.53,1:01:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听得懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.87,1:01:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不完全懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuh-uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.83,1:01:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那衣服有诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some supervillain shit right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.33,1:01:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电影都这样演\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's in every movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.83,1:01:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉亚公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.25,1:01:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《美女与野兽》的贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belle from beauty and the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.59,1:01:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《印第安纳琼斯》那个白人女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That white chick from Indiana Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.30,1:02:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.51,1:02:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该看看我在战士瀑布穿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see what I have to wear at warrior falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.48,1:02:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.98,1:02:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会把我丢在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not leaving me in here, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.52,1:02:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.65,1:02:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.03,1:02:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.99,1:04:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.78,1:04:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, feel free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.46,1:04:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.59,1:04:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我母亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my mother's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.39,1:05:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是中美洲文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all mesoamerican artifacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.40,1:05:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该来自16世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely 16th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.48,1:05:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从那时活到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been alive since then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的母亲是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother was human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.66,1:05:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.83,1:05:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来她成了别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she became something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.20,1:05:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么变 - 怎么变\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - "How?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.83,1:05:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方法绝对不如原因重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How" is never as important as "why."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.55,1:05:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西班牙征服者赶走我母亲和村民\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother and her village were driven from their farms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.85,1:05:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强占农田 从另一个世界带来天花\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Spanish conquistadors who brought the smallpox,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.77,1:05:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种可恨的语言 和教义\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hateful language, and dogma from another world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.44,1:05:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面临饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facing starvation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.32,1:05:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争与疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}war, and disease,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.61,1:05:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的族人向恰克求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}my people turned to chaac...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.07,1:05:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的雨水与丰饶之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our god of rain and abundance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.16,1:05:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克让我们巫师看到一个幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaac gave our shaman a vision...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.46,1:06:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救族人的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to save his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.75,1:06:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克带他到一株蓝岩中长出来的植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaac led him to a plant sprouting from a blue rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.60,1:06:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲当时腹中怀着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother was pregnant with me at the time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.98,1:06:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不肯吃下那种植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she did not want to ingest the plant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.40,1:06:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,担心对我造成影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}for fear of what it may do to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.78,1:06:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但巫师的说法令人信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the shaman was convincing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.52,1:07:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都病倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all fell sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.52,1:07:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their lives,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.53,1:07:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那里的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}their existence there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.82,1:07:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.00,1:07:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种植物夺走他们呼吸的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plant took away their ability to breathe air{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.42,1:07:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却使他们能从海中吸取氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}but enabled them to draw oxygen from the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.55,1:07:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在海中定居下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They settled in the ocean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.97,1:07:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,远离战争与疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}away from war and diseases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.25,1:08:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲在那里生下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother gave birth to me there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我成了塔洛坎出生的第一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I became the firstborn son of talokan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.43,1:08:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种植物给了我脚踝上的翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plant gave me wings on my ankles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.68,1:08:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及一对朝天耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ears that pointed to the clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.56,1:08:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.72,1:08:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能在空中游泳 老得比较慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could swim in the sky and age slower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.15,1:08:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸我们祖先呼吸的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe the air our ancestors breathed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.90,1:08:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年纪大了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}As she grew older,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.82,1:08:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲思念她曾熟悉的陆地生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mother mourned the life on land that she once knew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.32,1:08:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抑郁而终\N{\fnArial\fs30}And died with a broken heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.83,1:08:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要我答应将她葬在家乡的土里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made me promise to Bury her in the soil of her homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.92,1:08:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没料到会在那里发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing could prepare me for what I found there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.18,1:09:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个西班牙教士咒骂我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Spanish man of faith cursed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.35,1:09:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死在我的手下之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he died by my hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.39,1:09:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他称呼我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he called me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.86,1:09:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缺少爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child without love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.61,1:09:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字就是这么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I took my name from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.45,1:10:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Namor."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.33,1:10:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我对陆地没有爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have no love for the surface world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.16,1:10:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我说这些做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.67,1:10:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你明白我为何得杀那个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that you can understand why I have to kill the scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.96,1:10:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们带她去瓦坎达呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we took her to wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.92,1:10:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.72,1:10:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会待在我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will remain in my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.39,1:10:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能冒险 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot risk that, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.01,1:10:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就把我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then keep me instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.60,1:10:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看你的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to see your nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.56,1:10:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这副模样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can't go down there in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.23,1:10:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你几乎立刻就会失温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypothermia will grip you almost instantaneously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.86,1:10:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的血液会有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood will become toxic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.20,1:10:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海洋的压力会压碎你每根骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the pressure of the ocean will break every bone in your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.20,1:10:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也能穿潜水装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can wear a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.87,1:10:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几件 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have some of them. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.71,1:10:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.07,1:12:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 纳摩 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Namor, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.32,1:14:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.35,1:14:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.31,1:14:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是振金制成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's made of vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.81,1:14:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.90,1:14:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在海洋深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the depths of the ocean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.90,1:14:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将阳光带给我的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought the sun to my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.24,1:14:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你希望我饶了那科学家一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wished me to spare the life of the scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.07,1:14:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你知道我得保护什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you see what I have to protect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.14,1:15:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜奇雅 你的直觉没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia, your hunch was correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.39,1:15:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我侦测到苏睿基莫由耳环的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have picked up a location on shuri's kimoyo earrings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.76,1:16:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讯号来自一座水底洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal is coming from an unden/vater cavern{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.56,1:16:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在海面下约140米\N{\fnArial\fs30}approximately 140 meters below the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.64,1:16:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王后 我发现她的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen mother, I've found her signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.11,1:16:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自一座水底洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from an underwater cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.23,1:16:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她在那里 我一定会遭到阻力\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's down there, I'm sure I'll encounter resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.90,1:16:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我如何进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like me to proceed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.74,1:16:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不计代价救回公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrieve the Princess by any means necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.29,1:16:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会设法引诱纳摩出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will attempt to draw namor out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.41,1:17:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是第一个从陆上来到塔洛坎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the first person from the surface to come to talokan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.66,1:17:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请收下这代表我们谢意的纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take this as a token of our gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.88,1:17:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它用拯救塔洛坎的植物制作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was made with the plant that saved talokan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.26,1:17:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还年轻 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are young, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.51,1:17:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你到我这年纪 就会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you age as I do, you realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.60,1:17:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会失去每个心爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all lose everyone we love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但失去我哥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I lost my brother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.27,1:17:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just felt different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.06,1:17:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他默默受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suffered in silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.32,1:17:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后他向我求助时 我却帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he finally asked me to help him, I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.40,1:17:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么道理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that make sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.07,1:17:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祖先赋予我天赋与能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the ancestors would give me gifts and skills{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.91,1:17:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我哥 我却没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help me save my brother, and I couldn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.63,1:17:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题我没有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have an answer for that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.26,1:17:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的祖先常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ancestors would often say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.17,1:18:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受过最大苦难者才能成为伟大领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}"only the most broken people can be great leaders."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.35,1:18:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很佩服你在这里的建设\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire what you have built here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.81,1:18:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及你用心保护人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how you've protected your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.06,1:18:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但身为瓦坎达公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as Princess of wakanda,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.28,1:18:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能容忍你杀害那个小女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not stand for you killing that young woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.45,1:18:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我回去 我的国家不会善罢干休\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nation will not rest until I'm returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.95,1:18:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有她我不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.83,1:18:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须找到和平解决的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a peaceful way to resolve this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.21,1:18:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重点已经不是那个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is no longer about the scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.01,1:18:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几百年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.64,1:18:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陆上国家征服奴役我们这种民族\N{\fnArial\fs30}the surface nations have conquered and enslaved people like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.18,1:18:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了争夺资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.06,1:18:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从埋葬母亲的那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the day I buried my mother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.48,1:18:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就让人民准备面对他们来犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have prepared my people for the time they will come for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.48,1:18:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那台机器代表时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that machine is the sign that the time is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须知道瓦坎达是敌是友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know if wakanda is an ally or an enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.33,1:19:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有灰色地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no in-between.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.33,1:19:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你打算对全世界开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you plan to wage war on the entire world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.63,1:19:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还希望瓦坎达帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want wakanda to help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.88,1:19:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太离谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.21,1:19:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何国家有机会都想掠夺瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a nation that wouldn't plunder wakanda if given a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.18,1:19:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we make an alliance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.26,1:19:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能先发制人 保护彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can protect each other by striking them first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.52,1:19:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等摆脱那些国家的威胁后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, when the threat of these nations has been eliminated,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.94,1:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个科学家就能回到瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}the scientist will be returned to wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.98,1:19:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果瓦坎达不接受呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if wakanda does not accept, what then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.86,1:19:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,科学家难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scientist will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.82,1:19:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达将是第一个瓦解的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wakanda will be the first nation to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.99,1:19:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,攻击我的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}An attack on my people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.87,1:19:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.50,1:19:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.04,1:19:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达打不赢塔洛坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda cannot win a war with talokan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.85,1:20:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚我听到你和你母亲在河边的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you that night, with your mother at the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.43,1:20:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想烧光这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to burn the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.36,1:20:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们一起烧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us burn it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.50,1:20:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉玛达王后不肯卖振金给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen ramonda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.17,1:20:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们绑架建造机器的小女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they abducted a young woman who built the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.21,1:20:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我直言 莉莉威廉斯是天才少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with all due respect, riri Williams is a child prodigy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.30,1:20:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比她麻省理工学院的教授更厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was running circles around all of her professors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.67,1:20:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达人招募她加入他们的交流计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wakandans were recruiting her as part of their outreach program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.72,1:20:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.30,1:20:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们却趁夜黑风高派特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, you guys send in a SWAT team under cover of night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.85,1:20:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逮捕一个国际强权的女王储\N{\fnArial\fs30}to arrest the crown Princess of an international superpower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.44,1:21:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统想对瓦坎达采取攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president wants to take offensive action against wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.65,1:21:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪种攻势\N{\fnArial\fs30}What type of offensive action?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.24,1:21:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暗中颠覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destabilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.95,1:21:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯探员是我们的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, special officer Ross is our expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.45,1:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那 罗斯 你有何看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ross, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.83,1:21:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的消息来源指出祸首另有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sources are telling me that there's someone else out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.54,1:21:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 另一个国家 - 有可能 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another nation? - Could be. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.54,1:21:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得给我时间好好调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta give me enough time to investigate this properly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.79,1:21:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们到时候的交战对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise we're gonna find ourselves at war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.09,1:21:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会是一个军事实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a country whose military capacity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.01,1:21:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超乎想象的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't even comprehend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.55,1:21:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.01,1:21:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's the expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.35,1:21:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想攻击瓦坎达并不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be a mistake to attack wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.15,1:21:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.23,1:21:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们碰上问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.80,1:22:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的女儿还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my daughter alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.30,1:22:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Princess is alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.97,1:22:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她自己要求前往塔洛坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She requested to be taken to talokan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.97,1:22:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前她会留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will remain there for the time being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.98,1:22:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能用什么把她换回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I offer you in exchange?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.65,1:22:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.11,1:22:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我不认同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg to differ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.99,1:22:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们攻击美国人的开采船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans are preparing to blame wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.74,1:22:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们准备怪到瓦坎达头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your attack on their mining ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.45,1:22:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我的女儿和科学家回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return my daughter and the scientist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.58,1:22:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就告诉他们有你们这个国度\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will inform them of your existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你泄漏给美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tell the Americans about us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.51,1:22:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你设法找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you try to find us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.76,1:23:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者我在海上发现瓦坎达的船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if I discover a single wakandan ship in the ocean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.35,1:23:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就杀了公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill the Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.35,1:23:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会到瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will come to wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.31,1:23:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲手杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and iwill kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.62,1:23:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.54,1:23:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想对陆上国家开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to go to war with the surface world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.71,1:23:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要我帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and asked me to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.00,1:23:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.30,1:23:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们别想离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't never gettin' out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.71,1:24:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.84,1:24:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.76,1:24:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.39,1:24:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 珠子给我 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me your beads! - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.81,1:24:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 珠子给我 我能救她 - 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me your beads. I can save her. - We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.43,1:24:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿 我不认识她 但我们得听她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri, I don't know who this lady is, but we need to listen to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.89,1:24:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用声波攻击她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I hit her with a Sonic round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.23,1:24:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,近距离绝对致命 她活不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is lethal from this distance. There is no chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.56,1:24:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂 这会引发战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. This will mean war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.61,1:24:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们该走了 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go. - Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.57,1:25:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有对你怎样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they hurt you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.65,1:25:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.82,1:25:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.54,1:25:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 葛里奥 - 是 王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- griot. - Yes, my queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.83,1:25:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻带我们回瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return us to wakanda at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.80,1:28:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主 幸好您回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, it is good to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.76,1:28:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您离开后首都气氛紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city has been on edge since you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.64,1:28:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强化各水道的声波障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortify the Sonic barriers for all waterways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.39,1:28:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.31,1:28:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.27,1:28:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢祖先保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the ancestors. Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想还你这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to return these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.41,1:28:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Keep them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.74,1:28:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能很快会用上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might need them soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.16,1:28:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您在那边拿的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get that from down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.12,1:29:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您真的见到一个水中帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you saw an underwater empire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.75,1:29:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.17,1:29:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.01,1:29:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那些人很危险 安妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these people are dangerous, Aneka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.82,1:29:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 莉莉威廉斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, miss riri Williams,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.37,1:29:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得瓦坎达怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think of wakanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.70,1:29:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些故事根本是轻描淡写\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stories just don't do this place justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.83,1:29:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.04,1:29:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我真的很想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I really would like to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.26,1:29:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要耐心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will need to be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.01,1:29:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我至少能打给我妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I at least call my mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.47,1:29:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战犬娜奇雅已经将公主送回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Princess has been brought home by the war dog nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.94,1:30:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,荣耀哈努曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glory to hanuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.86,1:30:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个特务又救了瓦坎达一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. The spy saves wakanda once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.07,1:30:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信女王会赏她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The queen will reward her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.70,1:30:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终生流放\N{\fnArial\fs30}with lifetime banishment. I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.66,1:30:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.75,1:30:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨诺斯攻击过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Thanos' attack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.46,1:30:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不告而别\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you left without saying a word,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.21,1:30:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让人很伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}it hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.34,1:30:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很后悔没在你们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret not being there with all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.26,1:30:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那并不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.35,1:30:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.02,1:30:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家的国王和黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}King and black panther to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.52,1:30:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.45,1:30:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.03,1:30:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的帝查拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My t'challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.33,1:31:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说走就走 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he was taken away from me, just like that, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.04,1:31:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to step away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.83,1:31:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让自己好好伤心一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let myself break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.13,1:31:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.30,1:31:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像没事一样继续过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going as if nothing had happened, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.49,1:31:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭受攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.37,1:31:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.13,1:31:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗 没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.88,1:31:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥 启动日鸟号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot, activate the sunbird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.93,1:31:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.26,1:31:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正要赶去市区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making my way to the city right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.89,1:32:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准去 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down! That is an order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.51,1:32:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后 我和安妮卡能提供空中支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, I'm with Aneka. We can provide air support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.98,1:32:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 安妮卡 别让她离开 - 讯号有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aneka, do not let her leave the lab. - Mother, you're... You're breaking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.65,1:32:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听不见 苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.81,1:32:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 掰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you. Bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.02,1:32:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你挂掉王后的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hung up on the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.28,1:32:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我挂掉我妈的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hung up on my mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.44,1:32:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不一样 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a difference. Come. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.31,1:32:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invaders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.94,1:32:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama! Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.58,1:33:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,急救员受到一种声波催眠影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emts are suffering a form of Sonic hypnosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.46,1:33:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 塞住耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, plug your ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.46,1:33:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.97,1:34:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.72,1:34:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.73,1:34:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双臂交叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross your arms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.66,1:34:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜奇雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nakia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.92,1:34:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鱼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fish man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.57,1:36:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 他太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, he's too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.70,1:36:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在水中更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's even faster in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.60,1:36:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动系统超控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating system override.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.18,1:36:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 等等 我来修理 - 不能丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- NO! Wait! I'll fix it. - Can't leave you here, shuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.66,1:37:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.75,1:37:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有 在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.64,1:37:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.10,1:37:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 把你留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? And leave you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.72,1:37:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.41,1:37:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶 快出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye, move now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.60,1:39:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.73,1:39:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一周后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one week's time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.98,1:39:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会带大军回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will return with my entire army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.82,1:39:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们加入我们 对抗陆上世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will join us against the surface world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.24,1:39:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就让瓦坎达从地表消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will wash wakanda from the face of the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.16,1:39:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.62,1:39:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别让她过来 - 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep her back! - Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.66,1:39:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈妈… - 埋葬亡者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama! Mama! - Bury your dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.13,1:39:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哀悼至亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mourn your losses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.01,1:39:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是女王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are queen now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.84,1:39:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.72,1:39:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我 母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me! Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.02,1:39:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.73,1:39:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.86,1:39:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.86,1:39:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.58,1:40:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.08,1:40:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.88,1:40:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.72,1:41:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾巴里地民众请你节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jabariland offers you their comfort for your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.52,1:41:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must mourn her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.35,1:41:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,依照祖传的仪式来悼念她\N{\fnArial\fs30}in accordance to the rituals of your ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.24,1:41:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别埋首于你的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not Bury yourself in your technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.24,1:41:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.37,1:41:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应过你哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.24,1:41:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would provide you with counsel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.70,1:41:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.58,1:41:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今天我需要你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am in need of your advice today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.63,1:41:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的长老向我提议一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tribal elders have approached me with a proposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.68,1:41:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们希望撤离首都 在贾巴里地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wish to evacuate the city and set up camp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.10,1:41:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暂时安顿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in jabariland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.76,1:41:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你想听一个不屑传统的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now you are keen to hear from a child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.60,1:41:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发表意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}who scoffs at tradition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.48,1:41:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.40,1:41:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界对你太残酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world has taken too much from you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.82,1:42:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟你还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to still be considered a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.20,1:42:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is in my people's interest to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.21,1:42:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}which way your mind is leaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.54,1:42:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长老陷入绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The elders are desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.88,1:42:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首都脆弱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city is vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.01,1:42:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你提供他们生活所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are to provide for them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.30,1:42:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会万分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will be in great debt to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.64,1:42:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.90,1:42:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的心怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way is your heart leaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.78,1:42:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚埋葬了最后一个了解我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just buried the last person who truly knew me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.24,1:42:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心跟着她入土了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart was buried with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.83,1:43:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.78,1:43:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的橄榄油快坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, your olive oil's about to go bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.87,1:43:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.03,1:43:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肚子饿 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry. And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.12,1:43:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一场悲剧震撼国际社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragedy strikes the international community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.21,1:43:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉玛达王后 卢蒙巴之女惊传死讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sources can now confirm that queen ramonda, daughter of lumumba, has died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.04,1:43:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西方盟友表示原因可能是内战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Western allies say that civil conflict was the likely cause of the queen's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.68,1:43:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么看法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any comment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.18,1:43:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得你的朋友还瞒着你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what else your friends are keeping from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.86,1:43:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.35,1:43:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟瓦坎达王国私下没联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no unsanctioned contact with the kingdom of wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.28,1:44:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些珠子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the beads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.45,1:44:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.90,1:44:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.07,1:44:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你抵达那里之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had them bugged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.37,1:44:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在上面装了窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you ever even got there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.20,1:44:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过你每次对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been privy to every conversation you've had,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.12,1:44:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括那通与王后的叛国电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}including that treasonous call with the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.96,1:44:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿她安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}May she rest in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.75,1:44:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.21,1:44:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.42,1:44:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 瓦坎达人救过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You know what? The wakandans saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.63,1:44:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a good people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.34,1:44:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可曾想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever thought for a second{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.55,1:44:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they could be doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.35,1:44:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想过我们会怎么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever thought what we would be doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.85,1:44:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果美国是唯一有振金的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the us was the only country in the world with vibranium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.19,1:44:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还真的幻想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I actually dream about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.44,1:44:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小瓦 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Val. Val, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.48,1:44:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我德芳亭局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's director de fontaine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.99,1:44:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲保护我 把我当成自己小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother protected me like I was one of her own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.45,1:44:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我至少能回报她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least that I could do is try to return the favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.25,1:44:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得设法削弱纳摩的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a way to weaken namor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.79,1:45:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便如此 他还是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even weakened, he's still gonna be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.13,1:45:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹保护瓦坎达从未失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther has never failed to protect wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.30,1:45:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为黑豹走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the black panther was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.02,1:45:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哥死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.11,1:45:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不代表没有黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't mean the black panther is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.46,1:45:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.17,1:45:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先进行比较分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start by running a comparative analysis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.96,1:45:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比较制造合成心型药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}between our attempts at creating a synthetic heart-shaped herb...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.26,1:45:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及这手环的纤维\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fibers from this bracelet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.81,1:45:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.39,1:46:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然这从富含振金的土壤长出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this was grown from vibranium-rich soil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.40,1:46:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能具有我们能利用的类似特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}they may share some base-level similarities that we can exploit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.03,1:46:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.62,1:46:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦也上传我哥的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please upload my brother's DNA also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.20,1:46:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上传中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uploading now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.90,1:46:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么长得跟他们不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}why doesn't he look like them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.40,1:46:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的生理构造截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}His physiology is completely different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.78,1:46:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能飞也没有尖耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them fly or have pointed ears like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.95,1:46:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看守我们的女人嘴上和脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The women that were guarding us, they had water over their mouths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.12,1:46:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都有水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on their necks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.91,1:46:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他却没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.08,1:47:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有几种动物不需鳃从水中汲取氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several organisms don't need gills to extract oxygen from the water, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.67,1:47:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像水母\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a jellyfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.38,1:47:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从皮肤吸收氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just absorbs the oxygen from his skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.51,1:47:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这过程叫扩散 - 扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a process called diffusion. - Diffusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.12,1:47:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要一天没选出统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day that passes without selecting the ruler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.08,1:47:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就浪费一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a day wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.62,1:47:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在纳摩带战士回来前处理掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must deal with namor before he brings his warriors back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.21,1:47:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如何处理威力那么强大的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we to deal with a man with that much power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.76,1:47:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在击落你的飞机前\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that attack, before he took out your plane,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.63,1:47:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跳回水中\N{\fnArial\fs30}he jumped back into the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.05,1:47:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是那让他更强大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's what makes him strong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.97,1:47:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从皮肤上的水吸入氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breathing air and getting oxygen from the water on his skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.68,1:48:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果让他干掉 他就不会那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could find a way to dry his ass out, he won't be as strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.27,1:48:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这办法好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.60,1:48:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.57,1:48:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把皇家鹰爪战斗机变成渗透蒸发舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to convert the royal Talon fighter into a pervaporation chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.61,1:48:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that even possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.86,1:48:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.53,1:48:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得帮我们设计他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to help us trap him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.28,1:48:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请带威廉斯小姐去工作地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please show miss Williams where she's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.45,1:48:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.83,1:48:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你几岁建造第一台机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old were you when you built your first machine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.50,1:48:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.75,1:48:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我继父是汽车技工 他想造飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stepdad was a car mechanic. He wanted to build airplanes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.38,1:48:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给我工具 让我自己玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me these tools and let me just work it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.76,1:48:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是谁教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who taught you how to do all that you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.39,1:48:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My big brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.68,1:48:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾是瓦坎达军队最危险的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the tip of the spear of wakanda's army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.19,1:48:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.11,1:48:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何况我现在是一介平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'm a civilian now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.36,1:48:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我缴回了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned in my weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.36,1:48:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也为你打造了新矛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built you a new spear as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.91,1:49:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.08,1:49:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.45,1:49:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这鬼玩意叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this contraption's name anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.00,1:49:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,午夜天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The midnight angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.62,1:49:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,午夜天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midnight angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.00,1:49:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这能让我们与他们势均力敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will even the odds against them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.38,1:49:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 我要你随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister, I need you to be ready when I call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.68,1:49:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.47,1:49:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.35,1:49:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.15,1:49:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了几套\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of these did you make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.86,1:49:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去贾巴里前哨站找过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked for you at the Jabari outpost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.98,1:49:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不能逼我离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be forced out of my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.82,1:49:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很叛逆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have such a rebellious spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.45,1:49:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么加入朵拉亲卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you join the dora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.95,1:49:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何必在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.37,1:49:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我依然很想为国而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have a lot of fight left in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.38,1:49:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 安妮卡 凯亚娜之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Aneka, daughter of kyana,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.17,1:49:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你心中还有为国而战的斗志吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you still have some fight left in you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.55,1:50:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.62,1:50:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}griot,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.16,1:50:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信赖率多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's the confidence rate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.25,1:50:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,98.7% 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}98.7%, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.92,1:50:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您要我打印心型药草吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to print the heart-shaped herb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.89,1:50:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你回海地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd be back in Haiti by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.31,1:50:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是瓦坎达人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still wakandan, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.19,1:50:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近都在忙这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you've been up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.94,1:50:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.28,1:51:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have here, now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.45,1:51:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是恢复瓦坎达守护者的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a chance to restore wakanda's protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.75,1:51:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会是巴圣加发现心型药草以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be the greatest gift{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.62,1:51:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最伟大的赠礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}since bashenga's discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.09,1:51:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快就知道了 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll soon find out. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.47,1:51:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 葛里奥 - 是 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Griot? - Yes, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.01,1:51:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Print it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.27,1:51:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么知道有没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we know if it works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.77,1:51:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它会发光的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it glows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.08,1:51:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该烧香之类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, shouldn't we be burning incense or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.17,1:51:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有巴斯蒂知道祖先如何来到实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only bast knows how the ancestors will make it to this lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.68,1:52:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不要我埋葬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you don't want me to Bury you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.27,1:52:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你能触及我的胸部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you to have access to my chest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.48,1:52:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以防我心跳停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case I go through cardiac arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.10,1:52:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心跳停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cardiac arrest"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.73,1:52:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's joking,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.32,1:52:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.41,1:52:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.53,1:52:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,容许这心型药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow this heart-shaped herb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.75,1:52:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赋予你黑豹的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you the strength of the black panther{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.21,1:52:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带你前往祖先之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take you to the ancestral plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.92,1:54:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.26,1:54:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恩贾达卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}N'jadaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.10,1:54:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小堂妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lil' cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.64,1:54:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.73,1:54:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方法不如原因重要吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is never as important as why, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.36,1:54:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选择了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.77,1:54:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 我绝不会选你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible. I would never choose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.82,1:54:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何服下药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you take the herb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.49,1:54:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了见家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.37,1:54:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.41,1:54:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不相信祖先之地是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't believe the ancestral plane was real, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.29,1:54:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么服下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why did you take it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.25,1:54:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to lie to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.46,1:54:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can be strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.34,1:54:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强大要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong to do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.72,1:54:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.26,1:54:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们比你想的更相像\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're more alike than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.14,1:55:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我服用它也是要为祖先报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it to avenge my ancestors too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.27,1:55:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你完全不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.90,1:55:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took it for yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.81,1:55:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后毁掉剩下的药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}then destroyed the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.86,1:55:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胜之不武的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unworthy king,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.90,1:55:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕被取代\N{\fnArial\fs30}afraid of being replaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.49,1:55:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.74,1:55:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我壮士断腕 改变瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the courage to do what was necessary to change wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.83,1:55:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我登基前\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people like your scientist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.41,1:55:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达保护了几个科学家那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}did wakanda protect before I took the throne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.83,1:55:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懦夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.00,1:55:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是在我之前的那些黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the panthers that came before me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.34,1:55:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在帝查拉之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before t'challa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.42,1:55:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别提到我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.59,1:55:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是因为你才死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the reason why he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.76,1:55:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你烧毁药草 害我们失去守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burnt the herb, left us with no protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.18,1:55:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后纳摩进攻 杀了母后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then namor struck and killed my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.60,1:55:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的手上沾满他们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blood is on your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.60,1:55:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能算在我头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.48,1:55:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不准…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't you dare{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.02,1:55:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藐视你母亲的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}take that away from your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.02,1:55:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她牺牲自己 保护那失落部落的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sacrificed her life to protect a young girl from the lost tribe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.90,1:55:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲是伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father, he was a hypocrite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.08,1:55:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也会杀了那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've killed that girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.54,1:56:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就杀了自己的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, he killed his own brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.04,1:56:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉太高尚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}T'challa was too noble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.88,1:56:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让杀父凶手活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let the man who murdered your father live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.34,1:56:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.68,1:56:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要像你哥一样高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be noble like your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.98,1:56:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}or take care of business...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.77,1:56:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.73,1:56:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.61,1:56:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你见到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.20,1:56:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.08,1:56:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.67,1:56:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.68,1:56:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.92,1:56:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们抛弃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They abandoned me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.89,1:56:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们绝对不会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would never do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.39,1:56:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了所有该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did everything I was supposed to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.01,1:57:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重制药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}I re-created the herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.93,1:57:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了那蠢仪式 为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did your stupid ritual, and for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.14,1:57:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别激动 - 他们为何不来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. - Why didn't they come for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.77,1:57:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.98,1:57:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.62,1:57:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能服用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get some of that too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.37,1:57:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.96,1:57:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要一套战服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to need a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.03,1:58:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有更多人会从首都来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more people coming from the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.12,1:58:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要更多空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need more space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.91,1:58:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.79,1:58:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.21,1:58:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能完成任何事就是奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a wonder how anything gets done with you people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.04,1:58:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Princess!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.40,1:59:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has done it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.40,1:59:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.25,1:59:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳摩认为瓦坎达不堪一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namor believes wakanda is on her knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.13,1:59:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的王后遭杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our queen murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.10,1:59:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首都毁损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our capital destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.31,1:59:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他相信我们没有守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes we have no protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.15,1:59:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.94,1:59:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是反击的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is our time to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.11,2:00:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么反击 我们根本找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, when we don't even know how to find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.28,2:00:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让纳摩自己送上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll bring namor to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.16,2:00:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 又来这里 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, again? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.87,2:00:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海上的一个偏远地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A distant location at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.37,2:00:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.87,2:00:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say this does work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.59,2:00:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假设我们能杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Assuming we can kill this man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.54,2:00:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会飞 可能壮如浩克\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can fly and is potentially as strong as the hulk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.34,2:00:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死他就是解决之道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is murdering him the right solution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.22,2:00:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要他的项上人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were calling for his head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.35,2:00:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的罪不过是恐吓而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}when his only crime was intimidation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.85,2:00:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么变了 恩巴库大王\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has changed, lord m'Baku?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.81,2:00:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的士兵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soldiers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.18,2:00:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并未称呼他将军或国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}did not call him general or king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.98,2:00:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫他库库尔坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called him k'UK'ulkan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.81,2:00:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.19,2:00:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,羽蛇神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feather serpent god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.90,2:00:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.99,2:00:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为我们住在山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think because we are living in the mountains,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.15,2:00:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就没书可看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do not have access to books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.33,2:00:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位长老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elders,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.20,2:00:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your permission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.74,2:00:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想单独跟恩巴库大王谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to talk with lord m'Baku alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.59,2:01:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳摩还不会松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namor's not finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.34,2:01:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他誓言摧毁陆地世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised to destroy the surface world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.60,2:01:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是我们杀他的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is our opportunity to take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.10,2:01:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在怕什么 - 战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you afraid of? - War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.77,2:01:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果纳摩真是他人民心中的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}If namor is indeed a god to his people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.27,2:01:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他可能引发永恒之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing him will risk eternal war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.98,2:01:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.69,2:01:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我母后的命不值得永恒之战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was my mother's life not worth eternal war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.20,2:01:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.57,2:01:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她当然值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.66,2:01:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她不会希望你那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is not what she would have wanted for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.34,2:01:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也不是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is not what I want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.68,2:01:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要给我人民的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.77,2:02:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得好像母后还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of my mother as if she's still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.73,2:02:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说她希望我如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what she would've wanted for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.82,2:02:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的希望和梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her hopes and her dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.28,2:02:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.83,2:02:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.54,2:02:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳摩淹死她 就在我眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namor drowned her, right in front of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.84,2:02:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, her dreams,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.30,2:02:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的目标 对我的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}her goals, her hopes for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.72,2:02:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.68,2:02:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.31,2:02:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是我要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What matters is what I want,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.35,2:02:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要纳摩的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what I want is namor dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.07,2:02:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得帮我实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to help me get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.00,2:03:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一大早出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.45,2:03:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.62,2:03:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.24,2:03:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we survive this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.12,2:03:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了你和我在海地有个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know you have a home with me in Haiti.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.17,2:03:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来 握住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Take my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.18,2:04:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿 老实对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri, I want you to be honest with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.85,2:04:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你服下药草后见到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you see when you took the herb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.07,2:04:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你为了复仇而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go to war for vengeance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.86,2:04:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,填补不了失去她所留下的空缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will not fill the hole left from her loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.95,2:04:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它只会变得更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will only grow larger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.99,2:04:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后会吞噬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it will consume you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.70,2:04:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它已经吞噬掉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It already has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.46,2:05:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.83,2:07:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉 上面状况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riri, how's it going up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.08,2:07:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. Griot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.41,2:07:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could really use that backup right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.04,2:07:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你不会开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lthought you'd never ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.80,2:07:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.26,2:07:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 他真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, he's fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.31,2:07:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.49,2:07:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看我对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.88,2:07:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你的了 苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on you now, shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.39,2:08:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 公主 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Princess... - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.26,2:08:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是黑豹 我是来报仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the black panther, and I'm here for retribution!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.43,2:08:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,渗透蒸发舱启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pervaporation cells activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.86,2:08:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.61,2:08:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要一杯水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a glass of water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.91,2:08:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逮到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, we got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.92,2:08:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太好了 - 纳摩被逮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good! - Namor has been captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.13,2:08:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,返回瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to wakanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.34,2:08:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.41,2:09:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.41,2:09:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,声波发射器被摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sonic emitter has been destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.52,2:09:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.14,2:10:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹 海豹号失去动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panther, the sea leopard has lost power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.39,2:10:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们死伤惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they are experiencing significant casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.98,2:10:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okoye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.15,2:10:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.61,2:10:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aneka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.03,2:10:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥克耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}O koye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.94,2:10:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.21,2:10:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}For wakanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.96,2:10:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.51,2:10:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛里奥 受损状况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griot, what's the damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.14,2:10:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受损惨重 他的矛以纯振金制成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catastrophic. His spear is made of raw vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.68,2:10:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 船随时会爆炸 - 带我们到沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The ship could explode at any second. - Get us to the desert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.99,2:11:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.72,2:12:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐 我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, sis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.80,2:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.07,2:14:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get offme!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.34,2:14:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.16,2:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果公主不快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the ancestors save us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.00,2:14:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿祖先能救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the Princess does not hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.71,2:14:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能会去见祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be going to join them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.33,2:14:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If so, hey,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.58,2:14:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带他们通通一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us take as many of them with us as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.95,2:15:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原本可以不必如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've been different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.06,2:15:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要像你哥一样高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be noble like your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.52,2:15:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}or take care of business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.02,2:15:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}like me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.23,2:15:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.19,2:16:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纳摩会向我求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namorwill beg me for mercy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.86,2:16:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会眼睁睁看着他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I stand and watch as he dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.21,2:16:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.22,2:18:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.27,2:18:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.23,2:18:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他看见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.90,2:18:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的本色\N{\fnArial\fs30}who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.28,2:18:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.49,2:18:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达会保护你们的海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wakanda will protect your oceans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.00,2:19:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会保守你们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will protect your secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.42,2:19:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yield,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.67,2:19:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的人民就能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your people will live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.47,2:19:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇使我们疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance has consumed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.26,2:19:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能让它伤害我们的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot let it consume our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.90,2:20:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.24,2:20:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.20,2:21:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.52,2:21:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.03,2:21:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备回家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All set to head home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.40,2:21:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你确定警方不会在机场等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you're sure the police won't be waiting for me at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.19,2:21:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 都处理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Took care of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.99,2:21:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是帮人做作业的生意最好暂缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you might want to slow down on your homework-for-hire business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.70,2:21:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出包被逮到我可帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get caught slipping, I can't help you with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.37,2:21:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说你有事跟我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said you wanted to talk to me about something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.37,2:21:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.71,2:21:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的战服 设计得很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your suit. It's a great design,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.46,2:21:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不能让你带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but can't let you leave with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.88,2:21:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.17,2:21:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我能帮瓦坎达替我收拾善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured the least I could do is help wakanda clean up my mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.47,2:21:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一样东西给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one more thing to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.39,2:22:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.39,2:22:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花了一段时间才从河里找到所有零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me a while to find all the parts from the river,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.64,2:22:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是很值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.69,2:22:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.02,2:22:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我爸的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my dad's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.82,2:22:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前常改装它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to work on it before...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.49,2:22:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定是这辆 - 整台都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you sure this is her? - Every part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.54,2:22:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把它运到波士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it shipped to Boston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.16,2:22:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会比你先到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there before you arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.00,2:22:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.59,2:22:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹 威廉斯小姐的座驾到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panther, miss Williams' transport has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.51,2:22:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.39,2:22:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不去芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you're not trying to slide to Chicago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.97,2:22:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看场公牛队比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch a bulls game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.31,2:22:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该很有趣 但我有事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds fun, but I have something I need to take care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.51,2:23:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在让我们欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I present to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:21.13,2:23:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess shuri,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.47,2:23:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the black panther!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.24,2:23:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹向各位问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black panther sends her regards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:45.87,2:23:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她今天无法到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she will not be joining us today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.99,2:23:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 恩巴库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, m'Baku,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.12,2:23:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾巴里部落领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}leader of the Jabari tribe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.83,2:23:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦坎达之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of wakanda,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.79,2:23:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望挑战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}wish to challenge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.63,2:24:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.60,2:25:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.02,2:25:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能调头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we turn around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.85,2:25:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得 那会浪费一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. We'll lose an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.23,2:25:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去看一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go check it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.73,2:25:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:45.82,2:25:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是萧佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is shauver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.53,2:25:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有棵树挡住去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, looks like we got a tree blocking our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.70,2:25:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you want us to proceed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.79,2:25:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.96,2:26:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殖民者被链住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A colonizer in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.97,2:26:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have seen everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.09,2:26:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.88,2:26:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.55,2:26:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.72,2:26:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.10,2:26:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me one moment, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.64,2:26:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.14,2:27:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我该自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should do it on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.23,2:27:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.63,2:31:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shuri,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:40.97,2:31:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能加入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can we join you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.76,2:31:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我儿子 杜桑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my son, toussaint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.98,2:31:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杜桑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toussaint,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:51.64,2:31:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你姑姑苏睿\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your aunty, shuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.03,2:31:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.13,2:32:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为他在这里长大比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed it was better for him to grow up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.96,2:32:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,远离继位的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from the pressure of the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:25.43,2:32:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.26,2:32:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}your baba,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:29.18,2:32:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们准备好接受他离世 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}prepared us for his death, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:36.52,2:32:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他不要我们参加葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't want us to go to the funeral{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:39.40,2:32:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得时机还不适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he felt the time was not yet right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:43.03,2:32:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己在这里为他办了仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we had our own ceremony for him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:47.57,2:32:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母后见过他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did my mother meet him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.24,2:32:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.84,2:33:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:02.51,2:33:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杜桑这名字真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toussaint is a beautiful name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.55,2:33:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蕴含了一段伟大的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}It holds a great history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.84,2:33:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 你的名字也很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Yours is cool, too, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.43,2:33:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈说你很会保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom says you are good at keeping secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:15.69,2:33:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:17.94,2:33:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我能保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can keep a good secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.74,2:33:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杜桑是我的海地名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toussaint is my Haitian name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.08,2:33:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫帝查拉王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is prince t'challa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.37,2:33:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帝查拉国王之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of king t'challa.{\r}
